<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle market inactive - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle market inactive - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was quiet, with no sales slaughter steers or heifers confirmed, USDA said.</p>
<p>Inquiry and demand light. Feedlots very current. Bids and asking prices not well established Friday as both buyers and sellers mostly completed week's transactions.</p>
<p>This week's confirmed sales 98300 head including 24500</p>
<p>head or about 25 percent contracted or formulated cattle.</p>
<p>Confirmed - none   last week - 400   last year - 2,700</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
